re.\n\nJe vous envoie la proposition commerciale de suite.\n\nAh, je n'ai plus d'énergie à vendre pour l'instant : ce post est clôturé."}],"1":[{"auteur":"didium","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_1/forums_galactiques/avatars/844.jpg","date_sans_annee":"21/10 10:39","soutien":2,"score":0,"id":48781,"texte":"Je vends aux enchères 15 mio d'énergie\nJe peux assurer le transport !\n- mise minimale 17 mio £\n- fin des enchères dimanche à 20:30"},{"auteur":"Ghislynx","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_1/forums_galactiques/avatars/60.jpg","date_sans_annee":"21/10 10:52","soutien":1,"score":0,"id":48787,"texte":"18 Mo\n\n( je peux fournir le transport si vous voulez)"},{"auteur":"didium","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_1/forums_galactiques/avatars/844.jpg","date_sans_annee":"22/10 20:17","soutien":2,"score":0,"id":49185,"texte":"Il reste 15 minutes avant la fin des enchères.\nSi rien ne change, Ghislynx remporte le marché!"},{"auteur":"Lewllyn","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_1/forums_galactiques/avatars/139.jpg","date_sans_annee":"22/10 20:19","score":0,"id":49186,"texte":"18.1 Mo!!!!"},{"auteur":"Ghislynx","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_1/forums_galactiques/avatars/60.jpg","date_sans_annee":"22/10 20:31","soutien":1,"score":0,"id":49188,"texte":"19"},{"auteur":"jean luc picard","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_1/forums_galactiques/avatars/1122.gif","date_sans_annee":"22/10 20:31","soutien":1,"score":0,"id":49189,"texte":"20 MO"},{"auteur":"dino","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_1/forums_galactiques/avatars/1291.jpg","date_sans_annee":"22/10 20:31","score":0,"id":49190,"texte":"20 MO!!!"},{"auteur":"Ghislynx","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_1/forums_galactiques/avatars/60.jpg","date_sans_annee":"22/10 20:31","soutien":1,"score":0,"id":49191,"texte":"22"},{"auteur":"dino","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_1/forums_galactiques/avatars/1291.jpg","date_sans_annee":"22/10 20:32","score":0,"id":49193,"texte":"23 mo"},{"auteur":"Ghislynx","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_1/forums_galactiques/avatars/60.jpg","date_sans_annee":"22/10 20:33","soutien":1,"score":0,"id":49195,"texte":"24"},{"auteur":"dino","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_1/forums_galactiques/avatars/1291.jpg","date_sans_annee":"22/10 20:33","score":0,"id":49196,"texte":"25 mo"},{"auteur":"Ghislynx","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_1/forums_galactiques/avatars/60.jpg","date_sans_annee":"22/10 20:41","soutien":1,"score":0,"id":49199,"texte":"27"},{"auteur":"dino","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_1/forums_galactiques/avatars/1291.jpg","date_sans_annee":"22/10 20:42","score":0,"id":49201,"texte":"28 mo"},{"auteur":"didium","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_1/forums_galactiques/avatars/844.jpg","date_sans_annee":"22/10 20:46","soutien":2,"score":0,"id":49205,"negatifs":{"presentation":1},"positifs":{"efforts":1},"texte":"stop stop!\n\nPour rester honnête avec Ghislynx (j'ai relancé les enchères) je lui accorde l'enchère à 19 mio (son vote de 20:31) car la fin des enchères était prévue pour 20:30.\n\nPour tous les autres : Je remet en vente un nouveau lot.\n\n20 mio d'énergie\n- je peux assurer le transport\n- fin des enchères lundi à 21H\n- mise minimale 25 mio, palier minimal de 500.000\n\nFaites vos jeux!"},{"auteur":"Ghislynx","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_1/forums_galactiques/avatars/60.jpg","date_sans_annee":"22/10 20:55","soutien":1,"score":0,"id":49211,"texte":"Merci."},{"auteur":"Sandor Darhan","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_1/forums_galactiques/avatars/896.gif","date_sans_annee":"23/10 15:25","score":0,"id":49290,"texte":"25M"},{"auteur":"smileyoyo4","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_1/forums_galactiques/avatars/700.gif","date_sans_annee":"23/10 15:28","soutien":1,"score":0,"id":49294,"texte":"30mo"},{"auteur":"ouranos","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_1/forums_galactiques/avatars/1125.jpg","date_sans_annee":"23/10 19:39","score":0,"id":49366,"texte":"35mo"},{"auteur":"Lewllyn","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_1/forums_galactiques/avatars/139.jpg","date_sans_annee":"23/10 19:40","score":0,"id":49367,"texte":"Hé, c'est moi qui ai gagné!! Il n'tait pas précisé que la fin des enchères serait reportée d'une minute.\n\nFin à 20h30, cela veut dire fin à 20h30, pas 20h31!!!!\n\nNiveau fiabilité, vous avez zéro!!!!"},{"auteur":"Sandor Darhan","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_1/forums_galactiques/avatars/896.gif","date_sans_annee":"23/10 20:43","score":0,"id":49401,"texte":"35.5M"}]}}